OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1787069924
OL,3,CDUP MP Jim Shannon charged with common
OL,4,Cassault
OL,6,FDUP MP Jim Shannon has been charged
OL,7,Fwith common assault of a woman.
OL,9,FThe alleged incident involving the 71-
OL,10,Fyear-old is said to have happened on
OL,11,FOctober 1, 2023.
OL,13,FThe case was listed at Newtownards
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,16,FShannon, with an address at DUP
OL,17,Foffices on Frances Street in
OL,18,FNewtownards, did not attend court.
OL,20,FHe has been an MP for Strangford since
OL,21,F2010.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/4
