OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1787069924
OL,3,CDUP MP Jim Shannon charged with common
OL,4,Cassault
OL,6,FThe defence counsel Conan Rea outlined
OL,7,Fthat he has lodged a defence statement.
OL,9,FThe court heard that the PPS will be
OL,10,Fapplying to amend dates on paperwork
OL,11,Fwhich they had lodged.
OL,13,FMr Rea, instructed by Donnelly and
OL,14,FWall solicitors, said however, that
OL,15,Fthe defence will be objecting to that
OL,16,Fcourse.
OL,18,FHe told Deputy District Judge Trevor
OL,19,FBrowne in that regard, the defence
OL,20,Fhave lodged a skeleton argument
OL,21,Fdetailing their objections.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/4
