OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1787069924
OL,3,CDUP MP Jim Shannon charged with common
OL,4,Cassault
OL,6,FWith prosecuting counsel set to reply
OL,7,Fto the submissions, Judge Browne
OL,8,Fadjourned the case to September 1.
OL,10,FShannon was first elected to Ards
OL,11,FBorough Council in 1985 where he
OL,12,Fserved as mayor in 1991 and 1992.
OL,14,FThe DUP politician was elected to the
OL,15,FAssembly in 1998, before being re-
OL,16,Felected in 2003 and 2007.
OL,18,FIn 2010, he entered the House of
OL,19,FCommons as an MP for Strangford, a
OL,20,Fposition which he still holds.JCatch
OL,21,Fup with the latest UTV Live on ITVX
